{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12397","headline":"赠李十六 · 钱起","name":"赠李十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"半面喜投分，数年钦盛名。\n常思梦颜色，谁忆访柴荆。\n忽听欵扉响，欣然倒屣迎。\n蓬蒿驻驺驭，鸡犬傍簪缨。\n酌水即嘉宴，新知甚故情。\n仆夫视日色，栖鸟催车声。\n自尔宴言後，至今门馆清。\n何当更乘兴，林下已苔生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12397.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12397","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}